## Winning mentality – Refuses to accept defeat; obsessed with improvement.
## Example: Michael Jordan — uses failure as motivation to dominate later.

## Growth mindset – Views setbacks as opportunities to learn.
## Example: Novak Djokovic — constantly reinvents his game and adapts.

## Clutch mentality – Performs best under maximum pressure.
## Example: Tom Brady — thrives in high-stakes playoff moments.

## Resilient mentality – Bounces back quickly after mistakes or injury.
## Example: Alex Smith (NFL) — returned after a devastating leg injury.

## Team-first mentality – Puts team goals above personal stats or fame.
## Example: Andrés Iniesta — always prioritizes teamwork and harmony.
